# ANTLR 4: ANTLR 4 documentation: grammar structure, lexer and parser rules; requirements/languages/antlr.md
name     antlr antlr4 g4
keyword  grammar lexer parser fragment import options tokens channels mode returns locals throws catch
keyword  finally
builtin  EOF skip more pushMode popMode channel type
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   ' '  : escapes
